            </note>
            <note corresp="#d266-f3" n="78" xml:id="d266-f3-content">
                <p>See letter from the Acting Secretary of State to President Wilson, May 14, 1920,
                    and its enclosure, <ref target="frus1920v01#pg_351"><hi rendition="#italic"
